// workbook with native cello features
@sheet Data
@header | Region | Amount[bg:#fff9c4] | Flag |
[italic] | *North* | 10 | TRUE |
| South | 15 | FALSE |
[bold] | ## TOTAL | =SUM(Amount[2:3]) | =SUM(!!Amount[2:3]) |

@sheet Report
| # Revenue | =Data!B2 | =Data!B3 |
| _Q1_ | =SUM(Data!Amount) | =Data!C2 |
| ~~legacy~~ | "TRUE" | 2026-01-01 |
